g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c6/7kcnebkwx6wv5tsjghpfueu4dso9ns6.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E7%A0%B4%E9%A3%8E%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%9B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c6/7kcnebkwx6wv5tsjghpfueu4dso9ns6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />破风并进\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。<br />✦每回合触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]次数额外增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]效果[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"明誓同征\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">明誓同征</font></span></span>]的伤害、回复效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">25%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦每回合触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]次数额外增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]效果[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"明誓同征\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">明誓同征</font></span></span>]的伤害、回复效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">35%</font>，并额外驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦每回合触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\